---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>STR4T0TT0 — Staging</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="STR4T0TT0 staging environment for the next-generation editorial publishing platform."
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <main class="page-shell">
      <header class="site-header">
        <img
          src="/brand/logo-str4t0tt0-on-dark.svg"
          alt="STR4T0TT0"
          class="brand-logo"
        />
        <span class="environment-label">PRIVATE STAGING BUILD</span>
      </header>

      <section class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Editorial publishing platform</p>

        <h1>Strategic intelligence for digital systems.</h1>

        <p class="lead">
          STR4T0TT0 is rebuilding its publishing infrastructure around a faster,
          cleaner, and more controlled editorial system.
        </p>

        <div class="status-card">
          <span class="status-label">Migration status</span>
          <strong>Astro + Cloudflare Pages are operational.</strong>
          <p>
            This staging environment is now protected by Cloudflare Access and
            will be used to validate the new design, content model, and
            AI-assisted publishing workflow.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="system-grid" aria-label="Current publishing stack">
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <h2>Static core</h2>
          <p>Astro generates a fast, controlled, brand-first website.</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>02</span>
          <h2>Editorial cockpit</h2>
          <p>Notion will become the source of truth for content production.</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>03</span>
          <h2>Automation layer</h2>
          <p>Make will orchestrate AI drafting, review states, and publication.</p>
        </article>
      </section>

      <footer class="site-footer">
        <span>STR4T0TT0</span>
        <span>Staging environment. Authorized access only.</span>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .page-shell {
    width: min(100% - 2rem, var(--max-width));
    min-height: 100vh;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .site-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 0 4rem;
  }

  .brand-logo {
    height: 42px;
    width: auto;
  }

  .environment-label,
  .eyebrow,
  .status-label,
  .system-grid span,
  .site-footer {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .environment-label {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hero {
    max-width: 880px;
    padding: 2rem 0 4rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.55rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .status-card {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
  }

  .status-card strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .status-card p {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .status-label {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .system-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .system-grid article {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
  }

  .system-grid span {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .system-grid h2 {
    margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .system-grid p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .site-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-header,
    .site-footer {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .system-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .brand-logo {
      height: 34px;
    }
  }
</style>